    "body": "fix on issue/3328-drilling-hole-order · PR #3970 · pinned by start_exit_shared::hole_order::drill_cuts_the_picked_first_hole_and_last_hole, bore_cuts_the_picked_first_hole_and_last_hole, thread_cuts_the_picked_first_hole_and_last_hole_and_undo_restores_the_order, a_pick_that_is_not_on_a_hole_is_refused_by_name, a_pick_on_a_drill_with_cross_holes_is_refused_by_name, mcp_edit_operation_sets_the_hole_order_picks_and_undo_clears_them, drilling_axial::a_start_or_exit_pick_on_the_axial_hole_refuses_by_name · merges when reviewed\n\nThe viewport pick that snaps to a hole is not in this PR. The follow-up is #3960.\n",
